===Noun===
'''potter'''
# One who makes [[pot]]s and other [[ceramic]] [[ware]]s
# (religious, colloquial) [[God]]; [[creator]]
#*Isaiah 64:8, ''Old Testament'', New International Version:
#*:''O Lord, you are our Father. We are the clay, you are the '''potter'''; we are all the work of thy hand.''

